  "title": "Pear Conserve with Cherries and Hazelnuts",
  "description": "Great with Turkey with Apricot Glaze! Can be made without the nuts 4 days ahead; add the nuts just before serving. Originally submitted to ThanksgivingRecipe.com.",
  "authors": [
    "Christine L"
  ],
